<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  html { background: #ffffff; }
  body {
    width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: #FFFFFF; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  *, *:before, *:after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .header {
    background: #2C3E50; padding: 10pt 40pt;
    height: 40pt; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  h1 { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20pt; margin: 0; }
  .content { padding: 10pt 40pt; }

  .section { margin-bottom: 8pt; }
  /* Using h3 for title to ensure it is treated as text block */
  .section-title {
    background: #F4F6F6; border-bottom: 2pt solid #F1C40F;
    margin: 0 0 3pt 0; padding: 3pt;
    font-size: 14pt; color: #1C2833; font-weight: bold;
    display: block; /* Ensure block display */
  }
  p, li { font-size: 11pt; color: #555; line-height: 1.2; margin: 1pt 0; }
  ul { margin-top: 1pt; padding-left: 12pt; }

  .grid { display: flex; gap: 15pt; }
  .col { flex: 1; background: #F4F6F6; padding: 6pt; border-radius: 5pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>第二篇：投资实战与操作指南</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="section">
      <h3 class="section-title">投资哲学</h3>
      <p>少输比多赢更重要。建立概率思维，追求长期稳健的收益。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="col">
        <h3 class="section-title">资产配置</h3>
        <p><strong>美林时钟 (Merrill Lynch Clock)</strong></p>
        <p>指导大类资产配置，顺应经济周期轮动。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h3 class="section-title">股票投资基础</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>价值投资：</strong> 寻找被低估的优质资产。</li>
          <li><strong>分析方法：</strong> 掌握基本面指标 (PE, PB) 与 K 线图基础。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>